      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the person in <Picture 1>. <Audio 1> establishes their voice.\n\nsummary:\nA locked portrait shot follows the supplied opening and closing compositions and the timed Mandarin performance.\n\nretention_analysis:\nKeep the facial features and wardrobe from <Picture 1>. Follow the tone and speaking rhythm of <Audio 1>.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] The person looks toward the window in soft daylight, then gently turns to the camera. They say <d>[Chinese] 这里的风真轻。</d> with an easy expression and natural lip movements, ending in the supplied closing pose.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nClose, quiet dialogue with a low indoor room tone.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
        1088,
        1920,
        56,
        "match"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "prompt": "subject_definitions: Gu Chengchuan is the young Chinese man whose identity is provided by <Picture 1>. He has the gentle youthful natural speaking timbre of <Audio 1>.\nsummary: An unbroken late-morning live-action medium close-up on a Hunan hillside beside a black car. Gu turns toward his colleague and raises one hand in a quiet request.\nretention_analysis: <Picture 1> reference for the identity, age, underlying face proportions and haircut. <Audio 1> reference for vocal identity and relaxed everyday delivery only. The supplied timed endpoint pictures fix the exact opening and closing composition.\ndetailed_description: At the beginning he looks downhill, then turns naturally to face Chen. His jaw and eyes remain anatomically consistent as he turns. Speak the following Mandarin line once, clearly, gently and matter-of-factly to a colleague: “把箱子全锁回去。” Full intelligible sentence spoken in the available time. Sharp eyes, hair and textured suit. The guard by the trunk remains silent.\noverall_soundscape: Natural close dialogue, low air in the pines and distant forest ambience.\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A",
        "width": 1088,
        "height": 1920,
        "length": 56,
        "ref_image_size": "match"
      }
